[node name="text" type="RichTextLabel" parent="." unique_id=1342643288]
z_index = -100
offset_left = 3.0
offset_top = 62.0
offset_right = 1146.0
offset_bottom = 2232.0
theme = ExtResource("1_4c57u")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 32
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 48
theme_override_font_sizes/italics_font_size = 64
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[i]Math[/i]

[b]Math is super cool, if you actually see what's happening and not just numbers![/b]
Math can be divided into 5 main categories (mostly)

[i]1 - Algebra[/i]
x,y,z,k,n,m,l, just a ton of letters
it's the main backbone of math when it comes to proofs and writing, but it can be scary as it gets really abstract
Some main topics you need to understand:
[left]
	-Equations
	-Notable products
	-Quadratics
	-Polynomials
	-Functions
	-Means
	-more to be added when we add it
[/left]
[i]2 - Combinatorics[/i]
Used for the number's most important job, Counting
It is used to count stuff in groups and quickly
Some main topics you need to understand:
[left]
	-And & or rules
	-Permutations
	-Choose function
	-
	-
	-
	-more to be added when we add it
[/left]"
horizontal_alignment = 1
justification_flags = 195
visible_characters_behavior = 1
script = ExtResource("6_7mycd")

